\itemize{
\item the closed dates report nothing (the \strong{deficit});
\item the release date reports its own items \emph{plus} the whole backlog (the \strong{spike});
\item items released late have inflated \strong{delays};
\item the release date draws on an unusually large number of distinct \strong{event dates}.
